{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3353, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3176, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3358, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f0bcf0edf0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf", "baseline_text": "그럼，시작하겠습니다", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では、はじめましょう", "pointer_offset": 3180, "unit": "dialogue:180d4d435f650c89", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 4025, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//私のパイが//ボーナスパイになっていますよ。", "pointer_offset": 3184, "unit": "dialogue:155fa97abd513fcb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3438, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것입니다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらです。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてください。", "pointer_offset": 3188, "unit": "dialogue:ce902cf73add7751", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3507, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2caf7d12f2ff0dff944f5f3f0c7f0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "그럼…//제가 딜러네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では……//わたしが親ですね。", "pointer_offset": 3192, "unit": "dialogue:d876295db3bc11a4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3992, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f381432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음은，//오오가미 씨가 딜러예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お次は、//大神さんが親ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 3196, "unit": "dialogue:ab7c12ee0cee4c22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3567, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f2b9f1b0f14bf0ef81432f2ff0dff944f0b2f3bbf0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "죄송해요，//제가 이겼네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すみません、//勝たせていただきましたよ。", "pointer_offset": 3200, "unit": "dialogue:05cd0a6534d92d94", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3608, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f0af81608143f9d0f26cf35df0f08144", "baseline_text": "아～，져 버렸네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ～ぁ、負けちゃった。", "pointer_offset": 3204, "unit": "dialogue:13296768305ccc56", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3631, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b4f0bc8143f2ddf0a5f0bcf0a9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "역시，강하시군요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さすがに、お強いですね。", "pointer_offset": 3208, "unit": "dialogue:f001d1d60bd8abaa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3656, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f14af184f0a5f246f0cef0b8f0cf8143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781442f2ff9a9fa48f2b88143f15af1f2f0dbf144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "수고하셨습니다，오오가미 씨．//한 번 더，어떠신가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おつかれさまでした、大神さん。//もう一度、いかがですか？", "pointer_offset": 3212, "unit": "dialogue:2f244e25dccc539f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3713, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f3f4f0cff8bcf1d4f98bf94af154f0a2f9c7f1cff29ef0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "또다시 만날 수 있으면 좋겠네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "また、お会いできるといいですね。", "pointer_offset": 3216, "unit": "dialogue:5b15c54f76974461", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT13MEL_.SBN", "offset": 3746, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 3220, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
